{:edb/db-before-t 1185 :edb/db-after-t 1186 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534498 50 #inst "2026-10-12T00:49:46.285Z" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186119829 1038 #edb/ref 17592186423177 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186393043 1071 "Find an equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(3,-5,-2)$ and is perpendicular to the line \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x=2-3t \\\\ y=3+4t \\\\ z=4-t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186393043 1071 "Find an equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(3,-5,-2)$ and is perpendicular to the line \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=2-3t \\\\ y=3+4t \\\\ z=4-t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534498 17592186045417 false] [17592186393043 1074 "Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨3,-5,-2⟩.$ Converting the parametric equations of the line to vector form, we get\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x=2-3t \\\\ y=3+4t \\\\ z=4-t\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,⟨x,y,z⟩=⟨2,3,4⟩+t\\text{ }{{⟨-3,4,-1⟩}_{⏟}}_{v}.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe direction vector of the line is $v=⟨-3,4,-1⟩,$ so a normal vector to the plane is \n\n$$\nn=v=⟨-3,4,-1⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-3,4,-1⟩ & =⟨3,-5,-2⟩\\cdot ⟨-3,4,-1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-3,4,-1⟩ & =-27.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186393043 1074 "Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨3,-5,-2⟩.$ Converting the parametric equations of the line to vector form, we get\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=2-3t \\\\ y=3+4t \\\\ z=4-t\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,⟨x,y,z⟩=⟨2,3,4⟩+t\\text{ }{{⟨-3,4,-1⟩}_{⏟}}_{v}.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe direction vector of the line is $v=⟨-3,4,-1⟩,$ so a normal vector to the plane is \n\n$$\nn=v=⟨-3,4,-1⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-3,4,-1⟩ & =⟨3,-5,-2⟩\\cdot ⟨-3,4,-1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-3,4,-1⟩ & =-27.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534498 17592186045417 false] [17592186423170 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423178 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423179 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423180 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423181 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1043 #edb/ref 17592186423182 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1045 "The Vector Equation of a Plane" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1046 #edb/ref 17592186423181 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046658 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049436 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423170 1053 #uuid "68a08d63-69d2-59f4-855e-ab9c40ae1bca" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423171 1080 "r\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=1" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423171 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423171 1083 #uuid "54c2e93d-88d9-55e5-8da7-a7c8857c95a2" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423172 1080 "r\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=0" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423172 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423172 1083 #uuid "865e5880-5d6c-5eb8-b605-32023bca731a" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423173 1080 "r\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=-1" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423173 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423173 1083 #uuid "88b7b35b-b8a9-55fa-b177-e46dd3a1176a" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423174 1080 "r\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=1" 13194139534498