aligned}]$ is normal to the plane.\n\nThe equation of the plane that passes though the point $P({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n$ can be given as\n\n$$\n(r-p)\\cdot n=0,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the position vector of any point on the plane, and $p$ is the position vector of $P.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ r\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423178 1058 #edb/ref 17592186423179 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423178 1062 #uuid "0ecb2ec2-22d0-5b28-bc73-c57c70725e45" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423178 1063 #edb/ref 17592186338831 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423179 1058 #edb/ref 17592186423180 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423179 1062 #uuid "2c8b595f-b1a8-514e-9b95-bb539ab93fc0" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423179 1063 #edb/ref 17592186393043 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423180 1062 #uuid "376b1716-abbb-51bb-97e6-b6e06c8b7140" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423180 1063 #edb/ref 17592186262855 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423181 1058 #edb/ref 17592186423182 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423181 1062 #uuid "3ecf110e-e7e0-5add-b305-ad1bf6c365c5" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423181 1063 #edb/ref 17592186423177 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423182 1058 #edb/ref 17592186423178 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423182 1062 #uuid "55812343-3b60-5de3-98f2-95ffd7bd0ddb" 13194139534498 17592186045417 true] [17592186423182 1063 #edb/ref 17592186393029 13194139534498 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-68a08d63-69d2-59f4-855e-ab